:"হোয়েন"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/wen/"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"যখন"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"while"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"হোয়াইল"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/waɪl/"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"যখন (চলাকালীন)"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"until"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আনটিল"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/ənˈtɪl/"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"যতক্ষণ না"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ২ — সবচেয়ে বেশি ব্যবহৃত ৬টি"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.১ and (এবং)"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have a pen and a book.  →  আমার একটা কলম ও একটা বই আছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He is tall and strong.  →  সে লম্বা ও শক্তিশালী।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"She cooked rice and I washed the dishes.  →  সে ভাত রাঁধল আর আমি বাসন ধুলাম।"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.২ but (কিন্তু)"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He is poor but honest.  →  সে গরিব কিন্তু সৎ।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I called him but he did not answer.  →  আমি তাকে ডেকেছিলাম কিন্তু সে সাড়া দেয়নি।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The book is old but useful.  →  বইটা পুরোনো কিন্তু কাজের।"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.৩ or (অথবা)"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Do you want tea or coffee?  →  তুমি চা না কফি চাও?"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hurry up, or you will be late.  →  তাড়াতাড়ি করো, নইলে দেরি হয়ে যাবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.৪ because (কারণ) ও so (তাই)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ফলাফল  +  because  +  কারণ                কারণ  +  so  +  ফলাফল"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conjunction"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কী আনে"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"উদাহরণ"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"because"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কারণ আনে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He did not come because he was ill."}}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"so"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ফলাফল আনে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He was ill, so he did not come."}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am happy because I passed the exam.  →  আমি খুশি কারণ আমি পরীক্ষায় পাস করেছি।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It was raining, so we stayed at home.  →  বৃষ্টি হচ্ছিল, তাই আমরা বাসায় ছিলাম।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"She is tired because she worked all day.  →  সে ক্লান্ত কারণ সে সারাদিন কাজ করেছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🚨 বাংলা থেকে আসা সবচেয়ে বড় ভুল বাংলায় আমরা বলি — \"যেহেতু সে অসুস্থ ছিল, সেহেতু সে আসেনি।\" দুই দিকেই শব্দ থাকে। ইংরেজিতে একটাই conjunction বসবে — দুইটা নয়। ❌ Because he was ill, so he did not come."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ Because he was ill, he did not come."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ He was ill, so he did not come."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.৫ although / though (যদিও)"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Although he is poor, he is honest.  →  যদিও সে গরিব, সে সৎ।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Although it was raining, we went out.  →  যদিও বৃষ্টি হচ্ছিল, আমরা বাইরে গিয়েছিলাম।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He came, though he was tired.  →  সে এসেছিল, যদিও সে ক্লান্ত ছিল।"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🚨 দ্বিতীয় বড় ভুল — একই কারণে ❌ Although he is poor, but he is honest."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ Although he is poor, he is honest."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ He is poor, but he is honest. নিয়ম: although ও but কখনো একসাথে বসবে না। একটা বেছে নাও।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৩ — if (যদি) ও শর্তযুক্ত বাক্য"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If  +  Present Tense ,  will  +  Verb"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ভবিষ্যতে কিছু ঘটার শর্ত বোঝাতে। খেয়াল রাখো — if-এর অংশে ভবিষ্যৎ হলেও Present Tense বসে।"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If it rains, I will not go out.  →  যদি বৃষ্টি হয়, আমি বাইরে যাব না।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you study hard, you will pass.  →  যদি তুমি কঠোর পরিশ্রম করো, তুমি পাস করবে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If he comes, I will tell him.  →  যদি সে আসে, আমি তাকে বলব।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you help me, I will finish it today.  →  যদি তুমি আমাকে সাহায্য করো, আমি আজই শেষ করব।"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🚨 তৃতীয় বড় ভুল ❌ If it will rain, I will not go."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ If it rains, I will not go. নিয়ম: একই বাক্যে দুইবার will বসে না। if-এর পরে Present Tense।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩.১ unless (যদি না)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"unless = if … not। তাই unless-এর পরে আর \"not\" বসে না।"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You will fail unless you study.  →  তুমি পড়াশোনা না করলে ফেল করবে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I will not go unless he calls me.  →  সে না ডাকলে আমি যাব না।"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"❌ Unless you do not study, you will fail."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩.২ when / while / until"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When I saw him, he was reading.  →  যখন আমি তাকে দেখলাম, সে পড়ছিল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"While I was cooking, he came.  →  আমি যখন রান্না করছিলাম, সে এল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wait here until I come back.  →  আমি ফিরে না আসা পর্যন্ত এখানে অপেক্ষা করো।"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📌 while-এর সাথে সাধারণত Continuous Tense বসে (was cooking, was reading)।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৪ — ৮টি Common Mistake"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"❌ ভুল"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ শুদ্ধ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কারণ"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Although he is poor, but he is honest."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Although he is poor, he is honest."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"একটাই conjunction বসবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Because he was ill, so he did not come."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He was ill, so he did not come."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"একটাই conjunction বসবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If it will rain, I will not go."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If it rains, I will not go."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"if-এর পরে Present Tense।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Unless you do not study, you will fail."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Unless you study, you will fail."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"unless-এর মধ্যেই \"না\" আছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He is poor, but honest man."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"He is poor but honest."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"দুই পাশে একই ধরনের শব্দ বসবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I like tea and I like coffee too."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I like tea and coffee."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"অপ্রয়োজনীয় পুনরাবৃত্তি বাদ।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Since he is poor, so he suffers."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Since he is poor, he suffers."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"so বাদ যাবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I will wait until you will come."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I will wait until you come."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"until-এর পরেও Present Tense।"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🗣️ প্রতিদিনের ৬টি কাজের বাক্য (মুখস্থ করো) I can''t come because I am busy. — আমি আসতে পারছি না কারণ আমি ব্যস্ত। If you need help, call me. — সাহায্য লাগলে আমাকে ফোন করো। I tried, but I failed. — আমি চেষ্টা করেছিলাম, কিন্তু ব্যর্থ হয়েছি। It was late, so I went home. — দেরি হয়ে গিয়েছিল, তাই আমি বাড়ি চলে গেলাম। Wait until I come. — আমি না আসা পর্যন্ত অপেক্ষা করো। Do you want tea or coffee? — তুমি চা না কফি চাও?"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৭ — আজকের হোমওয়ার্ক"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✍️ ৩০ মিনিটের কাজ"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. because ও so দিয়ে ৫টি করে বাক্য লেখো — একই ঘটনা দুইভাবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. if দিয়ে তোমার ভবিষ্যৎ নিয়ে ৫টি বাক্য লেখো: If I study hard, I will ____."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. আগের Lesson-এ লেখা তোমার ছোট বাক্যগুলো বের করো এবং conjunction দিয়ে জোড়া লাগিয়ে ১০টি বড় বাক্য বানাও।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. অংশ ৪-এর ৮টি ভুল খাতায় দুই কলামে লিখে রাখো।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ তুমি বুঝবে কীভাবে যে Lesson 13 শেষ? যদি তোমার লেখায় বাক্যগুলো আর ছোট ছোট ভাঙা টুকরো না থেকে একটার সাথে আরেকটা জুড়ে যায় — এবং \"Although… but…\" মুখ দিয়ে বের না হয় — তাহলে Lesson 13 তোমার হয়ে গেছে। এখান থেকেই তোমার ইংরেজি \"শিশুতোষ\" থেকে \"পরিণত\" হতে শুরু করবে।"}]}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', 'intermediate', 49, now())
