agraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"She has finished the work. → The work has been finished by her.  →  কাজটা তার দ্বারা শেষ করা হয়েছে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I did the work. → The work was done by me.  →  কাজটা আমার দ্বারা করা হয়েছিল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He bought a car. → A car was bought by him.  →  তার দ্বারা একটি গাড়ি কেনা হয়েছিল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"They were building a house. → A house was being built by them.  →  তাদের দ্বারা একটি বাড়ি বানানো হচ্ছিল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He had eaten the mango. → The mango had been eaten by him.  →  আমটি তার দ্বারা খাওয়া হয়েছিল।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I will do it. → It will be done by me.  →  এটা আমার দ্বারা করা হবে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He can solve the problem. → The problem can be solved by him.  →  সমস্যাটি তার দ্বারা সমাধান করা যেতে পারে।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You should help him. → He should be helped by you.  →  তাকে তোমার দ্বারা সাহায্য করা উচিত।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The teacher punished the boy. → The boy was punished by the teacher.  →  ছেলেটিকে শিক্ষক শাস্তি দিয়েছিলেন।"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Someone stole my bag. → My bag was stolen.  →  আমার ব্যাগ চুরি হয়েছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৩ — কখন Passive ব্যবহার হয়?"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[