passed."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Type 3-এ \"have + V3\" লাগবে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Unless you do not study, you will fail."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Unless you study, you will fail."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"unless-এর মধ্যেই \"না\" আছে।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If I will get time, I will call."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If I get time, I will call."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"একই ভুল — if-এ will নেই।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If he had came, I would have met him."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"If he had come, I would have met him."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"had-এর পরে V3 (come), V2 নয়।"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🗣️ প্রতিদিনের ৬টি কাজের বাক্য (মুখস্থ করো) If I were you, I would not do that. — আমি তোমার জায়গায় হলে ওটা করতাম না। If you need help, call me. — সাহায্য লাগলে ফোন করো। If I get time, I will come. — সময় পেলে আসব। If I had known, I would have told you. — জানলে তোমাকে বলতাম। If it rains, we won''t go. — বৃষ্টি হলে আমরা যাব না। Take an umbrella in case it rains. — বৃষ্টি হতে পারে, ছাতা নাও।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৯ — আজকের হোমওয়ার্ক"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✍️ ৩০ মিনিটের কাজ"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. তিন Type-এর গঠন খাতায় লেখো এবং প্রতিটির ৫টি করে বাক্য বানাও।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. একই বিষয় নিয়ে তিন Type-এ বাক্য লেখো — এভাবে ৩ সেট:    If I study, I will pass. / If I studied, I would pass. / If I had studied, I would have passed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. \"If I were…\" দিয়ে তোমার ৫টি স্বপ্ন লেখো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. তোমার জীবনের ৩টি আফসোস Type 3-এ লেখো: If I had ____, I would have ____."}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ তুমি বুঝবে কীভাবে যে Lesson 17 শেষ? যদি \"If I will…\" মুখ দিয়ে আর বের না হয়, এবং \"If I were you\" শুনে তোমার কানে স্বাভাবিক লাগে (was নয়) — তাহলে Lesson 17 তোমার হয়ে গেছে। এই দুটোই উন্নত ইংরেজির চিহ্ন।"}]}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', 'intermediate', 49, now())
